{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Instructions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Presenting a story in the form of the most well-known (short) visual novel since the 21st century! In the game, you will play as the protagonist to experience the daily love life with a beautiful girl and reach different endings through different choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is my debut work. Although it is not yet mature, I still hope it can bring you a wonderful experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each big story is pieced together from small stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In an unremarkable urban setting, the daily life of &quot;me&quot; and &quot;my&quot; sister is a tiny story within the big story of &quot;my&quot; life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this little story, something happens between the two of us, and our relationship changes. Meanwhile, this will have some unknown impact on &quot;my&quot; future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That's it, something insignificant and extremely small.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, am &quot;I&quot; the player outside the screen or the &quot;I&quot; who is the elder brother in the story?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Development &amp; Acknowledgments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Producer: \u9690\u85cf 123</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Script: \u9690\u85cf 123</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Program: \u9690\u85cf 123</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Art: \u6d6e\u6d41 flo (Sister's character illustration), \u307f\u3093\u3061\u308a\u3048 (Background art)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Music: \u9b54\u738b\u9b42\uff0cT - STUDIO</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sound Effects: \u6548\u679c\u97f3\u30e9\u30dc\uff0cT - STUDIO</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Special Thanks: \u665a\u751f\u6849\uff0call family members and friends who provided help</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u7ed3\u5c401","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstati